WEBVTT

00:00:01.081 --> 00:00:12.959
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.093 --> 00:00:18.665
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:18.665 --> 00:00:25.594
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.106 --> 00:00:37.142
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.317 --> 00:00:43.256
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.256 --> 00:00:50.662
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.433 --> 00:00:58.472
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:58.472 --> 00:01:05.345
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.345 --> 00:01:10.951
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:10.951 --> 00:01:17.224
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.224 --> 00:01:25.654
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:38.645 --> 00:01:40.977
Okay! Let's go, Chitto!

00:01:47.421 --> 00:01:51.118
I hope the director isn't
being too mean to Helga.

00:01:59.733 --> 00:02:01.997
Don't worry about it!

00:02:05.906 --> 00:02:07.931
We're almost there.

00:02:09.743 --> 00:02:12.007
Chikao is over there, right?

00:02:25.091 --> 00:02:29.994
SINON

00:02:34.901 --> 00:02:38.905
What's that?
Is Chikao always like this?

00:02:38.905 --> 00:02:42.676
It's never been like this before.
I wonder if something happened.

00:02:42.676 --> 00:02:45.611
-Is it because you ran away?
-No way!

00:02:59.659 --> 00:03:01.627
It's that guy!

00:03:03.897 --> 00:03:06.923
They said they were
looking for escaped criminals.

00:03:07.934 --> 00:03:11.905
What'll we do? We can't get
near the orphanage like this!

00:03:11.905 --> 00:03:14.508
-It's perfect!
-What is?

00:03:14.508 --> 00:03:17.377
An escapee is someone
who's running away, right?

00:03:17.377 --> 00:03:19.746
So it has nothing to do with
someone who's locked in!

00:03:19.746 --> 00:03:22.874
Oh, I see! Well, aren't you smart, Thoma!

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:27.816
In that case, let's climb up in back!
There's a place where we can get inside!

00:04:14.935 --> 00:04:19.306
Blast it! Who do they think they are
telling us not to leave the orphanage?!

00:04:19.306 --> 00:04:23.310
They're from a government
organization. It's better not to argue.

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:26.980
-Besides they're heavily armed!
-I know that!

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:29.749
But look, I don't know what happened,

00:04:29.749 --> 00:04:32.686
but letting a criminal escape
is just incompetence!

00:04:32.686 --> 00:04:34.620
Well, yes but, Director...

00:04:34.754 --> 00:04:38.358
If a dangerous criminal
really is hiding around here,

00:04:38.358 --> 00:04:42.963
what if one of the children is taken
hostage and the worst happens?

00:04:42.963 --> 00:04:46.433
Even without that,
the rumors about this place...

00:04:46.433 --> 00:04:49.002
Well if that happens,
it won't be my fault!!

00:04:49.002 --> 00:04:51.071
Those people will be held responsible!

00:04:51.071 --> 00:04:53.373
Don't worry over nothing!

00:04:53.373 --> 00:04:55.342
This is a small island.

00:04:55.342 --> 00:04:59.012
If an escaped criminal is hiding here
he'll be found in no time.

00:04:59.012 --> 00:05:02.413
As soon as they're done,
I want them gone, understood?!

00:05:29.509 --> 00:05:31.602
Let's go.

00:05:32.145 --> 00:05:34.340
-What's that?
-Thoma!

00:06:01.541 --> 00:06:05.238
-Chitto, where's Helga's room?
-Second floor on the north side.

00:06:10.016 --> 00:06:13.620
It's no good,
those guys aren't leaving.

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:17.681
Should I throw a rock at them?
Hey, Thoma?

00:06:19.025 --> 00:06:22.128
-Thoma?
-Hey! Over here! Over here!

00:06:22.128 --> 00:06:24.464
T-Thoma?!

00:06:24.464 --> 00:06:28.468
-We can get in from here.
-I-I can't climb up there!

00:06:28.468 --> 00:06:31.771
Don't worry! This tree has lots of
footholds, it's easy to climb.

00:06:31.771 --> 00:06:35.400
-Easy for you to say.
-Guess there's nothing for it.

00:06:35.508 --> 00:06:37.577
No way! No way! No! No!

00:06:37.577 --> 00:06:40.113
How do you manage
to move like that?

00:06:40.113 --> 00:06:42.843
-Shut up!
-Go on.

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:52.292
Helga.

00:06:52.292 --> 00:06:55.227
-She's not in there.
-That can't be...

00:07:00.734 --> 00:07:02.902
Well?

00:07:02.902 --> 00:07:05.029
Nobody's here.

00:07:07.207 --> 00:07:09.732
Helga's drawings!

00:07:11.311 --> 00:07:13.905
What a mean thing to do.

00:07:13.947 --> 00:07:17.883
She must be still be in
the disciplinary room.

00:07:21.154 --> 00:07:23.122
DISCIPLINARY ROOM

00:07:33.666 --> 00:07:35.869
Chitto! He's here! A ghost!

00:07:35.869 --> 00:07:38.394
Please forgive me!
It wasn't my fault!

00:07:44.911 --> 00:07:47.113
Helga!

00:07:47.113 --> 00:07:49.479
Chitto? Chitto!

00:07:56.723 --> 00:08:00.360
Chitto, you're okay.
I'm so glad.

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:02.487
Helga.

00:08:04.764 --> 00:08:06.994
I'm so glad...

00:08:14.107 --> 00:08:16.242
Hey, Chitto!

00:08:16.242 --> 00:08:18.578
Helga. This is Thoma
from Papin Island.

00:08:18.578 --> 00:08:21.047
-He's the one who rescued me.
-We met on the island yesterday!

00:08:21.047 --> 00:08:25.450
Remember? You were sleeping on
a stone statue near my house.

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:41.057
I guess you didn't notice.

00:08:42.402 --> 00:08:44.437
I came with Thoma to rescue you.

00:08:44.437 --> 00:08:46.806
With all this confusion,
we should be able to get away.

00:08:46.806 --> 00:08:48.797
Let's go.

00:08:54.948 --> 00:08:58.645
This is... You drew this?

00:08:59.319 --> 00:09:03.312
It's the place Helga wants to go.
And I'm going to take her there.

00:09:11.164 --> 00:09:13.792
Thoma, hurry, let's go!

00:09:14.467 --> 00:09:16.458
Yeah...

00:09:28.014 --> 00:09:30.107
Come on.

00:09:33.686 --> 00:09:35.755
Are you alright?

00:09:35.755 --> 00:09:37.848
Helga!

00:10:01.648 --> 00:10:04.208
Are you alright? Helga!

00:10:05.451 --> 00:10:06.686
Yes.

00:10:06.686 --> 00:10:08.847
I guess nobody's worried about me.

00:10:08.922 --> 00:10:10.757
-Thoma!
-What?!

00:10:10.757 --> 00:10:13.626
If you get Helga hurt,
you'll pay for it!

00:10:13.626 --> 00:10:15.685
Now, listen...!

00:10:20.099 --> 00:10:22.829
-It can't be!
-The escaped criminal?

00:10:27.674 --> 00:10:30.370
Help me.

00:11:06.946 --> 00:11:09.380
Help me.

00:11:32.405 --> 00:11:35.508
Please. Stay with me.

00:11:35.508 --> 00:11:38.411
This is the escaped
criminal they're looking for?

00:11:38.411 --> 00:11:40.813
What should we do, Thoma?

00:11:40.813 --> 00:11:42.838
What should we do?

00:11:43.282 --> 00:11:45.443
Helga?!

00:11:47.086 --> 00:11:49.179
Hey!

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:05.965
Thank you.

00:12:28.294 --> 00:12:30.463
Ma'am, you're an escaped criminal?

00:12:30.463 --> 00:12:32.498
Those men are after you, right?

00:12:32.498 --> 00:12:35.701
Don't worry, they haven't
noticed anything yet.

00:12:35.701 --> 00:12:40.306
No, I haven't done anything.
I'm not a criminal.

00:12:40.306 --> 00:12:43.376
If you're hurt, I can
take you home in my boat.

00:12:43.376 --> 00:12:45.537
Can you stand up?

00:12:46.312 --> 00:12:49.577
It's no use.
It doesn't matter where I go.

00:12:50.883 --> 00:12:53.010
Besides...

00:13:02.962 --> 00:13:06.762
My dead little sister has come for me.

00:13:08.935 --> 00:13:12.371
I won't live much longer.

00:13:12.371 --> 00:13:16.709
Ma'am, don't say things like that.
You need to be positive.

00:13:16.709 --> 00:13:19.512
What's the matter, Helga?

00:13:19.512 --> 00:13:21.537
What's wrong?

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:38.760
-Chitto is alive?!
-Y-Yes, and Helga is...

00:13:39.632 --> 00:13:42.066
-Again?!
-What should we do?

00:13:44.137 --> 00:13:47.940
Contact the police immediately!
Call off the search for Chitto!

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:50.408
-Let's go!!
-Y-Yes, sir!

00:13:53.112 --> 00:13:55.410
Where are you going, Director?

00:13:57.083 --> 00:13:59.847
Some children have run away!
Let me through.

00:14:00.453 --> 00:14:02.512
Didn't you hear me? Hey!

00:14:05.491 --> 00:14:09.328
I'm very sorry, but we can't let
anyone leave the orphanage.

00:14:09.328 --> 00:14:11.430
We're under orders.

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:14.667
-D-Director...
-I don't care anymore.

00:14:14.667 --> 00:14:17.192
You people will be held responsible then.

00:14:23.009 --> 00:14:27.647
Why... do I have to die?

00:14:27.647 --> 00:14:34.075
I'm... I'm only twenty-four! So, why?

00:14:38.958 --> 00:14:44.624
There are so many things I wanted
to do. Lots of different things.

00:14:45.698 --> 00:14:51.068
I made a promise to my mother,
that I would work hard.

00:14:55.374 --> 00:15:00.209
I believed that I'd find happiness,
as long as I worked hard.

00:15:03.683 --> 00:15:06.811
I'm sorry... Mother.

00:15:11.891 --> 00:15:14.227
What's she saying?
That she's twenty-four?

00:15:14.227 --> 00:15:17.163
Yeah, but she looks about eighty to me.

00:15:17.163 --> 00:15:20.132
- Yeah.
- It's the truth.

00:15:20.132 --> 00:15:22.802
You may not believe me but...

00:15:22.802 --> 00:15:25.862
Sinon. That's my name.

00:15:35.248 --> 00:15:38.751
It's true!
It says "24" on here.

00:15:38.751 --> 00:15:41.447
How old is the ID card?

00:15:45.658 --> 00:15:48.149
Mother...

00:15:48.561 --> 00:15:52.759
I wanted to see her
one more time.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:56.195
One more time...

00:16:00.773 --> 00:16:03.640
One more time...

00:16:12.084 --> 00:16:14.954
If you want to see her,
I'll bring you to her.

00:16:14.954 --> 00:16:17.149
Come on, cheer up!

00:16:28.267 --> 00:16:30.462
Lala.

00:17:03.469 --> 00:17:05.664
Who are you people?!

00:17:06.339 --> 00:17:08.341
-Ouch!
-What are you doing?!

00:17:08.341 --> 00:17:11.777
-That old lady isn't feeling well!
-Behave yourself, brat!

00:17:15.114 --> 00:17:17.344
Thank you.

00:17:23.189 --> 00:17:25.180
Why you!

00:17:29.962 --> 00:17:32.498
We're here to rescue that woman.

00:17:32.498 --> 00:17:35.626
We've no intention of harming her.
Don't worry.

00:17:58.524 --> 00:18:00.515
It didn't work?

00:18:10.936 --> 00:18:12.995
Professor Gherta.

00:18:18.277 --> 00:18:20.336
I see.

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:26.675
Sinon.

00:18:28.187 --> 00:18:30.655
You poor thing.

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:33.325
Any leads on the other two?

00:18:33.325 --> 00:18:35.361
There was a collision with
the orphanage's boat...

00:18:35.361 --> 00:18:37.763
...and the other boat
sped away.

00:18:37.763 --> 00:18:40.199
They probably split up.

00:18:40.199 --> 00:18:42.168
But I'm sure we'll catch up with them.

00:18:42.168 --> 00:18:44.637
We know where
they're going after all.

00:18:44.637 --> 00:18:46.672
Before they die...

00:18:46.672 --> 00:18:49.732
Before they succumb, take care
of them as best you can.

00:19:02.521 --> 00:19:05.115
Who is that lady?

00:19:13.065 --> 00:19:15.434
This woman committed
a serious crime.

00:19:15.434 --> 00:19:19.564
If you feel sorry for her, don't tell
anyone else about this. Understand?

00:19:25.911 --> 00:19:28.038
-Helga.
-There they are!

00:19:29.849 --> 00:19:32.716
Oh, no! Hurry, Helga!

00:19:36.922 --> 00:19:39.091
Hold it!

00:19:39.091 --> 00:19:41.059
Hurry up!

00:19:42.795 --> 00:19:44.820
Hang on tight!

00:19:45.631 --> 00:19:48.225
-Hold it!
-So long!

00:19:48.534 --> 00:19:50.703
Blast it! Chitto!

00:19:50.703 --> 00:19:53.873
Why don't you try coming after us?
You lamebrain trio!!

00:19:53.873 --> 00:19:56.175
That little brat!

00:19:56.175 --> 00:19:58.177
-Forget it!
-What?!

00:19:58.177 --> 00:20:01.908
-Are you sure, Director?!
-Those people can be held responsible!

00:20:01.947 --> 00:20:04.177
B-But...?

00:20:05.417 --> 00:20:08.020
We were threatened at gunpoint!

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:11.012
If anything happens,
just tell them that!

00:20:11.156 --> 00:20:13.181
Y-Yes, sir...

00:20:13.626 --> 00:20:16.652
-We did it!
-Serves them right!

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:44.521
I wanted to see her
one more time.

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:47.320
One more time...

00:21:56.061 --> 00:21:58.894
Can I really?! Thank you!

00:22:35.401 --> 00:22:45.208
At the bottom of the deep, clear sea
fukaku fukaku sukitooru umi no soko ni

00:22:45.477 --> 00:22:55.320
A small flower is resting
chiisana hana madoronderu

00:22:55.320 --> 00:23:00.053
The melody of a gentle wind
amayaka na kaze no shirabe

00:23:00.092 --> 00:23:04.927
Passes through a rainbow
niji wo kuguri

00:23:05.330 --> 00:23:14.466
The fish are playing in the sky
sakanatachi wa sora ni asobu

00:23:14.573 --> 00:23:19.645
Everyone plays the music of love
dare mo ga ai wo kanaderu

00:23:19.645 --> 00:23:24.917
A warm light came down
atatakana hikari futteta

00:23:24.917 --> 00:23:29.320
(A gaze) That gaze
(manazashi wa) sono manazashi wa

00:23:29.354 --> 00:23:33.659
Is unbound and becomes full
hodokete michiteku

00:23:33.659 --> 00:23:38.528
Embraced by water
mizu ni dakare
